# client/1.12.html IS committed: it is the client you hand out, and it does not
# give the brand away. The brand is sealed inside its payload (readable only
# after the login) and the file itself carries nothing but a PBKDF2 verifier of
# it; start.sh keeps the same pair in the same spirit (see the XOR'd blob in it).
# The plain text pair stays out of the repository:
#   .verified-client.env    the brand + UUID, also copied into the Space secrets
.verified-client.env

